title: 'Atelier Design: tells catalog, Design Read + dials, redesign mode'
summary: 'Audited leonxlnx/taste-skill (MIT, commit 717446e) and folded its strongest ideas into atelier-design as Atelier-shaped features: a tells catalog (checks with recorded overrides, not bans), a one-line Design Read plus an intent-dials board that constrains later boards, and a redesign mode (greenfield/preserve/overhaul) with an audit, a preserve: list of load-bearing names, and risk-ordered boards. Also replaced our own sample system, which used Fraunces + cream — the exact cliché taste-skill flags.'
